WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.060
This is the Dedication Chapter

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:06.220
from The Guide to Bodhisattva's Way of Life

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:09.920
by Master Shantideva.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.800
Thus have I completed writing

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.400
A Guide to the Bodhisattva's Way of Life

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:18.460
and I pray

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:22.120
that by this goodness every living being

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:26.600
may take up this way of life.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.080
By the power of this good deed too may any

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.840
single living creature in sickness or in

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:38.500
pain, of body or mind, in any corner of

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.160
this universe, be thrown into a sea of

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:43.320
bliss.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:46.480
And for as long as they may wander

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:50.500
in the circle of suffering life, may they

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.720
never lose this bliss. May every one of

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:58.160
them one day reach the bliss beyond all

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:01.320
other, and stay there

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.400
never-ending.

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:05.000
I don't know how many

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.600
realms of hell there are hidden in our

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:12.160
world; but by this power may every person

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:16.560
trapped in one instead find joy in the

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:19.520
joy of the Heaven of Joy.

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:20.720
May those who

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:23.640
freeze in the cold of hell be covered in warmth.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.360
May infinite showers of gentle

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:31.700
rain fall from vast bodhisattva clouds to

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:34.880
cool the searing pain of those who live

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:39.160
there in fire. May the forest of falling

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:42.240
leaves of knives turn for those who

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:45.440
live there into a pleasure grove of

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:48.560
shady bowers. May the daggers of the

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:52.640
trunks of the trees of Shalmali

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:56.840
sprout as the Wish-Giving Tree instead.

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:00.180
May the caverns of hell suddenly echo

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:01.440
forth

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:03.880
with the soft sweet song of the dove and

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:07.120
nightingale, ruby-throated sparrow,

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:11.680
graceful swans, birds of every kind, drawn

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:14.000
to the gentle waters that spring up

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:18.040
instantly there, covered with lotuses

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:21.120
whose delicate fragrance fills the air.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:24.860
May the heaps of burning embers of fire

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:28.720
become piles of precious jewels, and the

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:30.120
red-hot glowing

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:33.600
iron floor the ground of a new world,

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:36.800
sparkling in crystal light. May the

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:39.200
mountains that slam together, crushing

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:41.460
the crowds of helpless people between

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:45.040
them, turn to the palace temples of

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:49.200
heaven, filled with bliss-filled Buddhas.

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:52.260
In the moment that I speak may the great

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:55.320
rain of putrid filth, and stones of

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:58.520
solid fire, knives, and spears, turn

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:01.360
into a soft steady shower of fragrant

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:05.680
flower petals. And in the hells of anger,

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:08.440
where people snatch up rocks and sticks

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:12.180
to gash one another open, may they instead

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:15.120
gather up armfuls armfuls of petals,

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:20.620
laughing, tossing over each other. I send

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:22.360
the awesome power of the good deed that

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:25.520
I've done as well to all those trapped

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:29.080
within the river that cannot be crossed,

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:32.620
wrapped within the hell-flame there, with

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:34.680
all the skin and flesh ripped away from

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:37.660
their bodies, the bones jutting out in

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:40.040
the glistening white of freshly fallen

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:42.640
snow; may this power grow their bodies

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:47.120
back, in the form of divine Angels. And

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:50.040
then may the beings in hell take pause,

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:54.000
and wonder suddenly to themselves, "Why

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.440
now do the henchmen of the Lord of Death

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:59.660
and his vicious ravens, and the birds of

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:04.480
prey, why did they turn and run from us?

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:06.960
What glorious power has turned the night

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:11.080
of hell to golden day, and smothered us

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:14.240
within this happiness, this strength, this

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:17.840
bliss? Who could have such power?" And may

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:19.800
they raise their eyes and see the blue

00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:23.600
of sky, and seated in it The One Who

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:26.480
Holds the Diamond in Their Hand. And then

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:28.700
may joy spread in their hearts, so

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:31.740
powerful that it tears away every wrong

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:35.600
they ever did, and so then they can rise

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:41.200
and fly--fly away with this Buddha. May

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:44.120
a rain of lovely flower petals mixed with

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:47.460
cool and perfumed water descend in a

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:50.940
song and extinguish the flames of the

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:53.040
fires that burn in hell.

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:55.520
May the beings who lived there look upon

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:58.560
this sight, and suddenly be overcome by

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:01.480
happiness. And then may they think to

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.540
themselves, "Who could have done this

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:06.400
thing?" And may they turn and see before

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:09.540
them The One who Holds the Lotus in

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:13.120
Their Hand. And then may the hell beings

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.320
hear a voice that calls to them and says:

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:19.220
"Come my friends, so far away, cast away

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:23.360
your fears now, and come be at my side;

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:25.720
Come to the one whose power has stripped

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:29.040
away your agony and thrown you into joy."

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:32.240
And when they lay their eyes on this one,

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:36.860
on Gentle Voice himself or herself, may

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:39.320
every miserable creature there burst

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:42.240
forth in a song, a song that roars

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:45.220
throughout the hells, a song that sings: "You

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:48.040
are the Bodhisattva who protects every

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:50.760
single living being, overcome by your

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:53.800
love for them; you are the youth divine,

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:57.120
with your flowing locks, body blazing in

00:05:57.120 --> 00:06:00.320
light; how could it be that you have come

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:04.260
to us, and smashed the terrors here? Are

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:06.560
you not the one to whom a thousand gods

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:09.200
would run, to touch the tips of their

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:12.520
crowns at your lotus feet? The one whose

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:14.800
eyes glisten in tears of compassion for

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:18.400
us? The one on whom a constant shower

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:22.680
of petals falls? See him or her now--

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:25.920
surrounded by palaces filled with crowds

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:27.920
of celestial youths

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:30.680
singing out their praises!" Oh thus may

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:33.920
it come to pass, through the power of the

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:36.760
goodness that I have done: every

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:39.720
suffering being in hell, wrapped now deep in

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:44.060
happiness, standing staring up at clouds

00:06:44.060 --> 00:06:47.280
as they gather overhead, and the reality

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:50.040
of the bodhisattvas--the one whose name

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:53.400
is Sheer Excellence and all the rest--

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:56.320
uncovered fully in the light, sending

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:58.960
down upon them showers of the rain that

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:02.480
brings them bliss, cool soft rain, rain of

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:06.020
finest fragrance. And by this power may

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:07.860
every being who lives in the animal

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:11.100
realm be freed from the terror of

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:14.060
feeding off each other. May those who

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:17.920
live as craving spirits enjoy a life of

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:19.880
peace and plenty,

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:22.320
like humans of the isle of Haunting

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:26.380
Voice. May a stream of milk descend from

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:29.680
the hand of the Lord of Power, the

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:31.800
Realized One, the One Who Looks with

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:35.320
Loving Eyes, and may it fill the spirits

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:38.300
who crave, washing them too in a gentle

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:42.600
bath, leaving them cool and refreshed.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:45.320
And  by this power made the blind open

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:47.540
their eyes and see the beauty; may the

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:50.820
deaf hear the song of sound. May every

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:53.720
woman with child give birth as Maya, the

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:56.620
Buddha's angel mother, did him--without a

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:59.540
hint of pain. May those without

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:02.560
sufficient clothing be suddenly clothed;

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:04.920
may the hungry be instantly filled with

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:08.120
food. May those who suffer now from

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:11.260
thirst drink fine fresh water and other

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:14.700
delicious beverages. May every poor

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:16.640
person there is find all the money they

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:20.840
need; may those who grieve be comforted.

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:22.900
May those who've lost hope

00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:25.900
find hope anew, and security that will

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:29.420
never leave them. May every single being

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:32.440
who is sick within this entire universe

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:36.640
be suddenly, totally, cured. May every kind

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:38.780
of disease ever known to living kind

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:41.260
vanish now, forever.

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:44.560
May all those in any kind of fear be

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:47.400
suddenly freed from it. May those

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:50.820
imprisoned be released. May those

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:53.920
downtrodden come to power, all of us

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:56.760
living then as family, in harmony with

00:08:56.760 --> 00:09:00.320
each other. May all of those who are on

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:03.280
the road, to anywhere at all, be safe and

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:06.400
comfortable, wherever they are now. And

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:09.080
may they without the slightest trouble

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:12.000
find at the end of their journey the

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:15.820
thing they left their home to find. May

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:18.240
all those who've left dry land to travel

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:21.620
in boats or ships accomplish all they

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:24.680
set out to do. May they cross the dangers

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:27.380
of the waters and then return safe to

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:30.020
their homes, and the arms of friends and

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:33.780
family. May those who travel a barren

00:09:33.780 --> 00:09:36.520
waste, or mistake their way, who

00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:39.680
wander lost, suddenly come upon new

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:42.680
companions and find their way easily,

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:45.440
free of fatigue, without the slightest

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:48.160
danger of things like thieves or wild

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:51.760
beasts. May holy angels come and protect

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:54.520
all those who live in fear, with nowhere

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:56.440
to go, no path to follow:

00:09:56.440 --> 00:10:00.320
small children, the elderly, those with no

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:04.120
one to help them; those who cannot sleep,

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:09.160
those who are troubled, and the insane. May

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:11.060
they spend every life they still have to

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:13.560
live free of every obstacle to a

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:16.840
spiritual life: may they find firm

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.440
feelings of faith, and wisdom, and a

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:22.760
perfect capacity for love; may their

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:24.520
physical needs be filled,

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:28.340
may they lead good lives. May they have

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:31.520
all they need to live, forever,

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:34.500
without a moment's pause, as if they

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:37.820
possessed the treasure of the magic sky.

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:39.720
May they live together without ever

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:42.480
quarreling, without ever hurting each

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:45.700
other, enjoying instead the freedom to

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:50.040
live as they choose to. May every person

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:52.560
who is small or shy, who has no

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:55.080
confidence, become strong and full of

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:58.760
grace. May those who lived a life of need

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:01.120
and suffered from it physically

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:05.600
recover in resplendent health. May all

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.920
those who live in a place in society where

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:11.040
they are not treated right transform

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:14.220
forever to a position ideal. May those

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:16.460
who are looked down upon be raised up

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:18.840
high, and their arrogant friends be

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:21.960
tumbled to the ground. And by this

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:25.100
goodness I have done may every single

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:27.800
suffering being give up every single

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:32.300
harmful thought or word or deed; taking

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:35.360
up always in its stead thoughts and words

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:39.380
and deeds of virtue. May these beings

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:41.780
never cease to strive to reach the

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:44.320
ultimate goal, for others; and may their

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:46.940
hearts be swept away by the stream of

00:11:46.940 --> 00:11:49.940
loving conduct. May they abandon every

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:52.880
sort of dark behavior, remaining in the

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:56.760
care of every Holy Being. May every

00:11:56.760 --> 00:12:00.240
living soul enjoy a life immeasurably

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:04.020
long, living thus forever in a state of

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:06.660
constant bliss, so that even the very

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:11.760
word "death" is never heard spoken again.

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:14.760
May all the places that exist, in every

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:18.200
world there is, turn instantly into

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:21.500
gardens of elegant design, filled with

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:24.600
trees that grant your every wish. And may

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:26.440
the Enlightened Ones, along with their

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:30.040
daughters and their sons, walk amidst the

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:33.140
trees, singing out the sweet song of the

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:36.300
Dharma. And in each one of these places

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:39.480
may the very foundation the earth itself,

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:42.480
be transformed, from sharp stones and the

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:45.700
like, into the heavenly ground of lapis

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:48.520
lazuli--as smooth as the palm of your

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:52.180
hand, and soft to walk upon.

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:54.440
And like a precious jewel adorning this

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:56.960
same ground, may all the secret worlds

00:12:56.960 --> 00:13:00.080
that exist and all the goodness in them

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:03.780
abide atop these newfound lands, crowded

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:07.080
with Warrior Angels. And too, may all

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:08.680
who live and breathe hear the song of

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:13.260
birds, the wind in the trees, the light of

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:17.560
the sun, and the sky itself, singing aloud

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:20.780
to them an endless rhapsody of holy

00:13:20.780 --> 00:13:24.140
teachings. And wherever they go may they

00:13:24.140 --> 00:13:26.080
always meet the Enlightened Ones, and

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:27.800
their children who strive for

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:31.040
enlightenment. May they honor these Lamas--

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:33.560
the highest of beings--with endless

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:37.020
showers of offerings. May the lords of

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:40.380
the sky send down the rains on time, so

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:43.460
to bring forth plentiful harvests. May

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:45.980
all existing governments make their

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:48.520
decisions based on the teachings, and

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:52.340
thus made the whole world prosper. May

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:55.180
every medicine come to have the power to

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:57.860
cure; may the secret words fulfill all

00:13:57.860 --> 00:14:01.680
hopes. May the minds of gods and spirits

00:14:01.680 --> 00:14:04.340
of sickness alike be overcome with

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:07.220
thoughts of compassion. May no single

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:10.080
living being ever again feel a single

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:14.280
pain. May they never again feel afraid,

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:17.720
never again be hurt by another, never

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:21.600
again be unhappy. May places of spiritual

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:25.080
learning thrive, filled with people

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:27.660
reading sacred books, and singing them

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:31.060
out loud as well. May communities of

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:33.880
spiritual practitioners live always in

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:36.340
harmony, and may they achieve the high

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:40.060
goals for which they live together. May

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:41.860
all those who have ever taken the vows

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:44.720
of a monk come to master the arts of

00:14:44.720 --> 00:14:47.260
solitude, throwing off every kind of

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:50.000
distraction, gradually refining their

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:54.500
minds, learning perfect meditation. May

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:56.880
nuns forever find support for their

00:14:56.880 --> 00:15:00.220
physical needs, and live lives free of

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:03.240
conflict or any outside threat.

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:05.680
May every person who's ever become

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:09.180
ordained conduct themselves perfectly in

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:12.960
their moral code. And may any of those

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:16.520
who may have ever broken this code

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:19.320
regret what they've done, and always

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:21.040
work to clean the karma.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:23.720
May they then return to a higher birth,

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:26.580
and in their new life never see their

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:30.420
spiritual discipline fail again. May

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:32.320
every sage who lives in this world find

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:34.820
the honor due to them, and always be

00:15:34.820 --> 00:15:36.440
offered the food and other needs they

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:39.540
request. May they always take care that

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:42.280
their hearts are pure, and may they earn

00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:44.440
a good name that spreads throughout the

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:47.880
entire world. May none of these people

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:49.920
ever again undergo the pain of the lower

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:52.760
realms; in strength beyond the strength

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:53.760
of gods

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.280
may they quickly win the state of a

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:58.480
fully Enlightened One without the

00:15:58.480 --> 00:16:02.080
slightest hardship. May every suffering

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:04.820
being there is make offerings over and

00:16:04.820 --> 00:16:07.040
over again to every Enlightened Being

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:09.860
there is. And may the Enlightened Ones

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:12.880
enjoy forever what we have offered them,

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:16.840
in infinite waves of bliss. May every

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:19.180
plan there is in the heart of every

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:22.040
bodhisattva to help every living being come

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:25.360
true. May everyone get every single thing

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:28.480
that the Enlightened Ones who shelter us

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:32.400
have in mind for us to get. May those who

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:34.520
follow the lower paths of self-made

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:37.400
awakened ones, and listeners, attain the

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:41.360
happiness they seek. And may we, through

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:44.700
the kindness of Gentle Voice, remember in

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:48.260
life after life who we are and what we

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:50.860
practice, rejecting the worldly way of

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:54.600
life again and again, until the day we

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:58.700
reach the level called Intense Joy. May

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.040
we gain the mystic ability to live off

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:04.160
even the poorest of food, growing ever

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:07.480
more strong and healthy. In all our lives

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:09.540
may we win the wealth of learning to

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:12.140
live in solitude with nothing more than

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:15.520
the barest needs. And when anyone ever

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:17.000
longs to see him,

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:20.000
or ask him even the slightest question,

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:22.700
may the shroud which covers their eyes be

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:26.000
torn away, so that the High Protector,

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:28.340
Lord Gentle Voice Himself, instantly

00:17:28.340 --> 00:17:30.580
appears.

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:32.080
We are working to achieve the

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:34.160
goals of all the living beings there are

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:36.420
in every corner of this universe;

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:37.080
and so

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:39.560
by this power may we learn to do every

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:42.180
single one of the things that Gentle

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:45.240
Voice is able to do. And may we decide

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:48.360
that we will stay to work to clear away

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:52.000
the pain of every living being there is

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:54.480
until the last day of this universe;

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:57.040
until the very last suffering creature

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:58.800
is changed.

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:00.780
May every single pain that is

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:03.000
coming to any single being there is

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:06.000
ripen now upon me instead.

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:08.760
May the great community of bodhisattvas

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:11.180
go forth and spread throughout through

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:13.920
all the world, to work for the happiness

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:15.460
of all.

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:16.560
The teachings of the Enlightened

00:18:16.560 --> 00:18:18.960
Ones are the one medicine that can cure

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:22.680
the great sickness of living kind. They

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:24.620
are the one ultimate source of every

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:27.960
form of happiness. And so by this power

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:30.540
may the teachings remain long upon this

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:33.080
planet, with all the support they require,

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:35.320
and all the respect they deserve.

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:36.080
And

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:38.820
lastly do I bow myself down to the one

00:18:38.820 --> 00:18:42.120
with a Gentle Voice, the One who has been

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:44.220
kind enough to teach me the ways of

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:45.160
virtue;

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:48.780
thus last do I bow myself down to the

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:51.740
One who was kind enough to raise me up

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:54.620
from childhood: I bow to You, my Spiritual

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:55.680
Guide.

